      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪！明明想动起来身体却动不了！\r\n……嗯！这倒也算\r\n挺有趣的体验不是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1f894b9548f5ddbb2f7e106760b4e19e6df1f3721f8f8f1ad4b0e3af37ecc8",
